# Vite SPA (this project)

Stack: Vite + React 19 + React Router. **No Next.js.**

- Shared engineering base: sibling `../agent-base/` (architecture, adaptive UI,
  React hygiene). Follow those docs/rules first.
- Routes live in `src/App.tsx` (or thin route modules). Screens in
  `src/presentation/**` take **data + callbacks** — do not import
  `react-router` into leaf screens when avoidable.
- `src/domain/**` stays pure (no React, no `window`).
- Path alias `@/` → `src/`.
- Lint: `oxlint`. Format: Prettier when present. Quality: `npm run check`.
- Static deploy: `dist/` + optional `VITE_BASE` for GitHub Pages.
